      "name": "Sentry's Warning",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Trigger The sentry is about to roll Perception or Survival to determine their initiative;\n\n---\nEffect The sentry visually or audibly warns allies, granting them a +1 circumstance bonus to their initiative rolls. Depending on how the sentry warns allies, this action has the auditory or visual trait.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "key": "unsupported",
